*20
/TITLE:  DAN10
/OCTOBER 27, 1970
/DISPLAYS A CROSS IF SENSE SWITCH
/ZERO IS ON, LINES ON SEPERATE CHANNELS
/LINES ARE MOVED BY LEFT AND RIGHT
/SWITCHES.  IF SWITCH THREE IS ON,
/LINES ARE MOVED BY ANALOG POTS
/TWO AND SIX.
/PROGRAM DISPLAYS AN UNMOVEABLE
/X IF SWITCH 1 IS ON, LINES ON SEPERATE
/CHANNELS.  BOTH DISPLAYS OCCUR
/SIMULTANEOUSLY IF BOTH ZERO AND ONE
/ARE ON.  COMPLETES EIGHTH LAB ASNMT.
