	JMP EX-2
	CLR
	SET I 14
	0377
	STC 15
	SNS 2
	JMP THERE
	SAM 2
	SCR 1
	STC VERT
	CLR
	SAM 6
	SCR 1
	ADM
	14
	JMP HERE
THERE,	RSW
	APO
	COM
	ADM
	14
	LSW
	APO
	COM
	STC VERT
HERE,	LDA
	14
	BSE I
	4000
	STC 14
	ADD AC
	DIS 14
	ADA I
	0001
